An '''Bloodbat''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
{{Green|3-6}} '''Bloodbats''' can be found sleeping on the outside walls of the mansion or on the ceilings of the mansion in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Bloodbats''' sit still, then fly around after the player first throws a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} at them and it bounces off. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Bloodbat''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

